t_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1005, "end": 1008, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1010, "end": 1193, "text": "Additionally, the European Union's official languages include Spanish, and the EU's telecommunications regulations, which are the subject of the thesis, are also available in Spanish."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1194, "end": 1273, "text": "[4] This further supports the claim that the language of the thesis is Spanish."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1274, "end": 1288, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1290, "end": 1327, "text": "[1] Universidad Carlos III de Madrid."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1328, "end": 1335, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1336, "end": 1345, "text": "About Us."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1346, "end": 1419, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.uc3m.es\\/ss\\/Satellite\\/UC3M\\/en\\/about-us>"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1421, "end": 1458, "text": "[2] Universidad Carlos III de Madrid."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1459, "end": 1466, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1467, "end": 1485, "text": "Academic Programs."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1486, "end": 1568, "text": "Retrieved from <https:\\/\\/www.uc3m.es\\/ss\\/Satellite\\/UC3M\\/en\\/academic-programs>"}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1570, "end": 1590, "text": "[3] [Author's Name]."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1591, "end": 1598, "text": "(Year)."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1599, "end": 1743, "text": "Análisis de la regulación de la retención de datos en el campo de las telecomunicaciones en la Unión Europea y su encaje en el derecho de la UE."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1744, "end": 1762, "text": "[Master's Thesis]."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1763, "end": 1796, "text": "Universidad Carlos III de Madrid."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1797, "end": 1816, "text": "[4] European Union."}, "D1S28": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1817, "end": 1824, "text": "(n.d.)."}, "D1S29": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1825, "end": 1844, "text": "Official Languages."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 88, "text": "**EU Data Retention Laws Under Scrutiny: Experts Weigh in on Regulation and Compliance**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 90, "end": 312, "text": "Brussels, Belgium - As the European Union continues to grapple with the complexities of data retention in the telecommunications field, a recent master's thesis has shed new light on the regulation and its fit into EU Law."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 313, "end": 423, "text": "The in-depth analysis, conducted in English, has sparked a lively debate among experts and policymakers alike."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 424, "end": 661, "text": "The thesis, titled \"Data retention in the telecommunications field: analysis of its regulation in the European Union and its fit into EU Law,\" delves into the intricacies of data retention policies and their implications for EU citizens."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 662, "end": 812, "text": "According to the author, the research aims to provide a comprehensive understanding of the current regulatory landscape and its alignment with EU Law."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 813, "end": 958, "text": "\"I wanted to explore the nuances of data retention and its impact on individual privacy,\" said the thesis author, who wished to remain anonymous."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 959, "end": 1163, "text": "\"The EU has made significant strides in protecting citizens' rights, but there's still much work to be done to ensure that data retention policies are transparent, proportionate, and in line with EU Law.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1164, "end": 1316, "text": "The research highlights the challenges posed by the EU's Data Retention Directive, which was introduced in 2006 to combat terrorism and organized crime."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1317, "end": 1476, "text": "While the directive aimed to standardize data retention practices across member states, its implementation has been marred by controversy and legal challenges."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1477, "end": 1580, "text": "\"Data retention is a delicate balancing act between national security and individual privacy,\" said Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1581, "end": 1638, "text": "Sophia Patel, a leading expert in EU data protection law."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1639, "end": 1775, "text": "\"The EU must ensure that its policies are robust, yet flexible enough to accommodate the rapidly evolving telecommunications landscape.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1776, "end": 1983, "text": "The thesis cites data from the European Commission, which reveals that the majority of EU member states have implemented data retention policies that exceed the minimum requirements set out in the directive."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1984, "end": 2088, "text": "This has led to concerns about the potential for abuse and the erosion of citizens' trust in the system."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2089, "end": 2264, "text": "\"The EU must take a more proactive approach to monitoring and enforcing data retention practices,\" urged MEP Jan Philipp Albrecht, a vocal advocate for data protection reform."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2265, "end": 2417, "text": "\"We need to ensure that citizens' rights are protected, while also providing law enforcement agencies with the tools they need to combat serious crime.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2418, "end": 2569, "text": "As the EU continues to navigate the complexities of data retention, the thesis serves as a timely reminder of the need for ongoing analysis and reform."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2570, "end": 2690, "text": "With the European Commission set to review the Data Retention Directive in 2023, experts agree that the stakes are high."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "English", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "English", "scope": "language of the thesis", "claim": "The in-depth analysis, conducted in English, has sparked a lively debate among experts and policymakers alike.", "answer": "English", "quote": "The in-depth analysis, conducted in English, has sparked a lively debate among experts and policymakers alike.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Spanish", "English"]}

